- `serialize(v)`: json.dumps(v, sort_keys=True, ensure_ascii=False) if not str else v
- iterate fields:
  - theorems: for line_no, raw line; parse; for key, value: scan(normalize(serialize(value)))
  - csv: DictReader; row_index (data row, 1-based), csv_line = row_index+1; for each key/value scan.
